    "Game Data Bundle File",
    "4.0",
    "File extension used for bundle files, which are data archives used in some applications or computer games, notably the Need For Speed: Most Wanted racing game titles; in the Need For Speed title, BNDL files include audio streams and other game sounds such as engine and siren sounds and other sound effects. Windows Need For Speed Most Wanted NFSHP bundle explorer EA Layer 3 Decoder.",
