    "Comic Book TAR File",
    "4.0",
    "Comic book archive created using the TAR archiver tool; contains a sequence of image files that can be displayed as a comic book using a compatible comic book viewer. CBT files can also be decompressed using a.TAR archive utility, such as StuffIt Expander. However, the image files may not be displayed in the correct order. Windows CDisplayEx. Smith Micro StuffIt Deluxe. Mac Smith Micro StuffIt Deluxe Mac 16. Contains user support and training data accessed by Microsoft Help; may also be referenced by other Microsoft applications and computer training programs. CBT is also a common abbreviation for Computer Based Training. Windows Microsoft Help.",
