    "WinAce Split Archive Part 1 File",
    "3.4",
    "First part of a compressed archive created by WinAce; split into several parts in order to fit on smaller media, such as floppy disks; saved with other parts of the archive that have file extensions C02, C03, etc; may also be preceded by a.C00 file. E-merge WinAce has been discontinued. Windows E-merge WinAce. Audio file format created by Typhoon, a third-party operating system for the Yamaha TX16W sampler developed by users. Windows WinVortex SOX. TX16WConverter Mac SndConv.",
