    "WinRK File Archive",
    "3.4",
    "Compressed archive created with WinRK; uses PWCM, FPW, ROLZ2, and ROLZ3 compression and other proprietary compression algorithms; may also incorporate.PAQ7 file compression techniques. Windows M Software WinRK.",
