    ".LHA",
    "LHARC Compressed Archive",
    "3.2",
    "File or group of files compressed with LHARC compression; popular compression format on Amiga computers and used by id Software to compress installation files for early games, such as Doom; LHA has been mostly replaced by the.LZH compression format, but is still widely used in Japan. Windows File Viewer Plus — Get it from Microsoft. Corel WinZip. Smith Micro StuffIt Deluxe. 7-Zip. Zipeg Mac Corel WinZip Mac. Smith Micro StuffIt Deluxe Mac 16. Incredible Bee Archiver. The Unarchiver. Audio Overload. Zipeg Linux 7-ZipFree.",
