    "HyperBac Compressed Archive",
    "3.0",
    "Compressed file archive created with the HyperBac compression utility; used primarily for compressing database files; supported database systems include Oracle, SQL Server, MySQL, SharePoint, IBM DB/2, Sybase, and SAP BRBackup. HBC files can provide up to a 90% reduction in required storage space compared to the original uncompressed files. Windows Red Gate SQL HyperBac —  (Discontinued).",
    "Windows Red Gate SQL HyperBac —  (Discontinued).",
