    "SimulationX Project",
    "3.0",
    "An ISX file is a project file used by SimulationX, an application used to simulate technical systems. The file is a compressed archive that contains CAD, recorded results, and animation data. The SimulationX project was introduced with the release of SimulationX 3.1. The project allows the saving and loading of models that can be encrypted with or without a password. Windows ESI ITI GmbH SimulationX.",
